@DiscordApp_HostAddress = http://localhost:5038

### Login
# @name login
POST {{DiscordApp_HostAddress}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Token — body IS the token, no nested field
@authToken = {{login.response.body.*}}

### Confirm it works
GET {{DiscordApp_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Send friend request
POST {{DiscordApp_HostAddress}}/api/friend-requests/send-friend-request
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "receiverId": "33a0a7d1-1993-435d-9900-b8e4fa50a606"
}